        "format": 1,
        "content": "<img class=\"sbn-retrato\" src=\"modules/seattle-by-night/assets/retratos/PJ-04.webp\" alt=\"Nadia Ferro\">\n<p class=\"sbn-enlace-actor\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-user\"></i> Sheet: @UUID[Actor.0IIsgytowpgAWwK6]{Nadia Ferro}</p>\n<p><strong>Concept:</strong> sound producer for Helen&#39;s podcast and childe of Prince Whitmore.</p>\n"
      },
