    {
      "_id": "IXO6LZebjn6nDIsI",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!rg50DlMYSzgbZeBv.IXO6LZebjn6nDIsI",
      "name": "Tension with David",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>They both orbit Helen. David keeps her away from the truth; Nadia pushes her toward it. David is an ally of the coterie and is with them every night: that tension is going to be at the table.</p>\n"
      },
